    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4976" root="جبل" body-key="j">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجبّلوا</span></b>  <i>They entered a mountain:</i> (K:)
or, accord. to the O, you say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجبّل القَوْمُ الجِبَالَ</span>,
meaning, <i>the people,</i> or <i>company of men, entered
the mountains.</i> (TA.)

